{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:caaf24587149e3b5","name":"Attack an Object","source":{"id":"source:reference-caaf24587149e3b5","title":"Attack an Object","revision":26244,"timestamp":"2025-02-23T20:31:38Z","sha256":"627e01afe497cf170b31a8dac31a190b948799132751291d7517b77bb60a0693","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26244","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Attack%20an%20Object&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-caaf24587149e3b5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sometimes you need to Attack an Object such as a door, a control console, or a held weapon, either to destroy it or bypass it. An unattended, immobile object has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 5 + its size modifier. If you hit it with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you deal damage as normal.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, an object usually has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," (DR), which means that any attack that hits it has its damage reduced by the indicated amount. (",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," ignore an objects' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},".) An object reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"},". If the damage that reduces the object to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," also equals or exceeds the object's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the object is destroyed instead.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Like characters, objects become increasingly debilitated if they take a lot of damage at once. If an object takes damage from a single attack that equals or exceeds its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", it moves -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". An object that moves -5 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Object Statistics"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Statistics for Objects\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OBJECT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DR\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["HIT POINTS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DAMAGE THRESHOLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STRENGTH (BREAK DC)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE MODIFIER\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufactured Objects"]},"\n"],"colspan":6}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Fine (",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"},")\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag