":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":["1: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," has the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", and Break DC as a weapon of the same size category as the wearer. A suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," pushed down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," imposes its condition penalties to the wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," only."]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Statistics for Substances\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SUBSTANCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DR\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["HIT POINTS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Paper (Flimsiplast, Durasheet)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Rope (Synthetic, Liquid Cable)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Soft Plastic (Synthmesh, Synthleather)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Glass (Duraplex, Plastex)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ice or delicate crystal\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ceramic (Ceramisteel)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Hard Plastic (Duraplast, Plasteel)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Wood (Synthwood, or any natural variety)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Light Metal (Transparisteel)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Stone (Permacrete, Ferrocrete)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Metal (Durasteel, Quadanium Steel)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Heavy Metal (Duranium, Lanthanide)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15 per cm of thickness\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Exotic Metal (Neutronium, Mandalorian Steel)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20 per cm of thickness\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Held Objects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A held, carried, or worn object is much harder to hit than an unattended object, and has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," equal to 10 + the object's size modifier + the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of the holder (not counting Armor Bonus or Natural Armor Bonus, if any).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Multipart Objects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Very large objects have separate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," totals for different sections. For example, you can break the window of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeder"}," without destroying the whole speeder.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Suitable Weapons"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The GM may determine that certain weapons just can't deal damage effectively to certain objects. For example, you will have a hard time breaking open a blast door with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cesta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cesta","referenceId":"reference:654b2bd481edb9c2"}," or cutting a cable with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Club"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Club","referenceId":"reference:72e81feaa8a14fac"},". The GM may also rule that certain attacks are especially successful against some objects. For example, it's easy to shear or ignite a curtain with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Strength"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["All objects have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," score that represents their innate ability to bear weight (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Encumbrance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Encumbrance","referenceId":"reference:7c0376ae0ea9eee1"},"). An object supporting weight in excess of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Load"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Load"}," moves -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," immediately, and another -1 step each round on the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Count"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Count"},". If an object is supporting weight in excess of twice its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Load"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Load"},", it is immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Breaking an Object"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you try to break something with sudden force rather than dealing regular damage, use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," check to determine whether you succeed. The DC depends more on the construction of the item than on the material, but it is usually equal to 15 + the object's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier. Attempting to break an object is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". If the object has moved down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", apply the condition penalty to the object's Break DC.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
